## netlab-corpus v1
## id: c19-gap-ledger
## kind: router
## provenance: authored
## note: the deferred-FR ledger — every marker must land one of the three
## note: honest-error classes. `interface vlan`/`interface vl` stand under
## note: the dormant-family pin: no v1 kind emits `vl<N>` canonical names,
## note: so no `vl<N>` key exists in any v1 IfMap; they flip to real
## note: goldens in the commit that adds a kind with `vl<N>` ports.

enable
conf t
## gap: FR-SVI
interface vlan 10
## gap: FR-SVI
interface vl 10
## gap: FR-SVI
ip default-gateway 10.0.0.1
## gap: FR-ACL-NAMED
ip access-list extended FOO
## gap: FR-DHCP-POOL tok2
ip dhcp pool VOICE
## gap: FR-NAT-POOL tok2
ip nat pool P1 1.1.1.1 2.2.2.2
## gap: FR-NAT-POOL
ip nat inside source list 1 pool P1 overload
## gap: FR-OSPF-DEEP
passive-interface g0/0
## gap: FR-AUTH
enable secret s3cr3t
## gap: FR-AUTH
line con 0
## gap: FR-AUTH
login
## gap: FR-AUTH
username admin secret pw
## gap: FR-AUTH
banner motd #hi#
## gap: FR-AUTH
privilege exec level 15 ping
## gap: FR-AUTH
exec-timeout 5 0
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
mac address-table static aaaa.bbbb.cccc vlan 10 interface fa0/1
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
arp 10.0.0.1 aaaa.bbbb.cccc arpa
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
logging buffered 4096
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
interface range g0/0-4
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
interface port-channel 1
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
aaa new-model
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
ip http server
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
snmp-server community public ro
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
ntp server 10.0.0.1
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
ipv6 unicast-routing
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
route-map RM permit 10
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
crypto key generate rsa
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
mpls ip
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
ip sla 1
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
cdp enable
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
lldp run
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
vtp mode server
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
spanning-tree vlan 10 priority 0
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
udld enable
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
service password-encryption
interface g0/0
## gap: FR-SVI
no switchport
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
mtu 1500
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
speed 100
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
duplex full
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
channel-group 1 mode on
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
standby 1 ip 10.0.0.254
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
vrrp 1 ip 10.0.0.254
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
hsrp 1 ip 10.0.0.254
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
monitor session 1 source interface g0/0
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
ip helper-address 10.0.0.9
exit
router ospf 1
## gap: FR-OSPF-DEEP
passive-interface default
## gap: FR-OSPF-DEEP
default-information originate
## gap: FR-UNBACKED
redistribute static
exit
end
## gap: FR-PING-EXT tok2
ping 10.0.0.1 repeat 5
## gap: FR-PING-EXT tok2
ping 10.0.0.1 size 100
## gap: FR-PING-EXT
ping
## gap: FR-EMACS tok1
terminal editing
## gap: FR-PAGER tok1
terminal length 0
